                    </ul>
                    <p>VAERS is co-sponsored by the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC), and the Food and Drug Administration (FDA), agencies of the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services (HHS).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- /.row -->
    </div>
